{
  "description": "P1-8 RAG final-answer benchmark. Each case is sent to the FULL agent; we score the final reply, not the top retrieval hit. Metrics: groundedness (expected_facts present, must_not absent), citation precision (every KB id cited in the reply points at a source whose content actually contains an expected fact), refusal accuracy (expect_refusal cases must decline instead of inventing). expected_facts strings are verbatim substrings of the KB entries so citation support can be checked mechanically. Coverage: every KB-001..KB-014 entry is exercised at least once. `alt_facts[i]` lists paraphrases accepted as equivalent to `expected_facts[i]` when checking the reply (spacing like 12 个月/12个月 is not a signal); the verbatim expected_facts remain the strings used for citation-support checks.",
